  "prefLabel": "Rev 2502.05 Financial Institution Service Fees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2502.05 Financial Institution Service Fees. Any transfer fees, service charges, discrepancies in exchange rate, or other fees charged by the taxpayer’s financial institution for ACH credit or debit participation shall be the responsibility of the taxpayer.\n\nSource. #8495, eff 11-30-05; ss by #10484, eff 12-5-13; ss by #13724, eff 8-18-23 (formerly Rev 2502.06) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 2500)",
